### 1. 注册新用户
POST http://localhost:8081/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tech_guru",
  "email": "guru@example.com"
}

### 2. 获取用户列表
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users/list

### 3. 发布新文章
POST http://localhost:8081/api/posts/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "title": "Deep Dive into Java 21",
  "content": "Java 21 introduces virtual threads..."
}

### 4. 发布另一篇文章
POST http://localhost:8081/api/posts/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "title": "Why Microservices?",
  "content": "Microservices architecture allows..."
}

### 5. 查看文章详情 (增加热度) - 文章 1
GET http://localhost:8081/api/posts/1

### 6. 查看文章详情 (增加热度) - 文章 2
GET http://localhost:8081/api/posts/2

### 7. 查看文章热度排行 (Redis ZSet)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/posts/hot-rank
